"Value booked on the transit account, in the currency of the company, frozen "
"when the notes are sent: the amount itself in the currency of the points of "
"sale, else the amount at the rate of Odoo of the day, like the cash moves of"
" POS Multi-Currency Cash."
msgstr ""
"Valor contabilizado en la cuenta de tránsito, en la moneda de la empresa, "
"congelado al enviar los billetes: el propio importe en la moneda de los "
"puntos de venta, si no el importe al tipo de Odoo del día, como los "
"movimientos de efectivo de POS Multi-Currency Cash."

#. module: pos_nm_currency_exchange
#: model:ir.model.fields,help:pos_nm_currency_exchange.field_pos_nm_exchange__linked_value
msgid ""
"Value compared to the identification thresholds: the received value plus the"
" operations of the customer over the linked operations period of the point "
"of sale."
msgstr ""
"Valor comparado con los umbrales de identificación: el valor recibido más "
"las operaciones del cliente durante el periodo de operaciones vinculadas del"
" punto de venta."

#. module: pos_nm_currency_exchange
#: model:ir.model.fields,help:pos_nm_currency_exchange.field_pos_config__nm_exchange_customer_threshold
#: model:ir.model.fields,help:pos_nm_currency_exchange.field_res_config_settings__pos_nm_exchange_customer_threshold
msgid ""
"Value of an exchange operation, in the currency of the point of sale, above "
"which the customer must be identified. 0: never required. With a linked "
"operations period, the value of the operations of the customer over that "
"period is added."
msgstr ""
"Valor de una operación de cambio, en la moneda del punto de venta, a partir "
"del cual debe identificarse al cliente. 0: nunca obligatorio. Con un periodo"
" de operaciones vinculadas, se suma el valor de las operaciones del cliente "
"durante ese periodo."

#. module: pos_nm_currency_exchange
#: model:ir.model.fields,help:pos_nm_currency_exchange.field_pos_nm_exchange_office__customer_threshold
msgid ""
"Value of an operation, in the currency of the company, above which the "
"customer must be identified. 0: never required."
msgstr ""
"Valor de una operación, en la moneda de la empresa, a partir del cual el "
"cliente debe identificarse. 0: nunca obligatorio."

#. module: pos_nm_currency_exchange
#: model:ir.model.fields,help:pos_nm_currency_exchange.field_pos_nm_exchange__value_out
msgid ""
"Value of the notes handed back at the sell rate of the counter (the rate of "
"Odoo less the exchange sell margin, or the lower fixed rate)."
msgstr ""
"Valor de los billetes entregados al tipo de venta de la ventanilla (el tipo "
"de Odoo menos el margen de venta de cambio, o el menor tipo fijo)."

#. module: pos_nm_currency_exchange
#. odoo-javascript
#: code:addons/pos_nm_currency_exchange/static/src/app/exchange_popup/exchange_popup.xml:0
msgid "Value of the notes received"
msgstr "Valor de los billetes recibidos"

#. module: pos_nm_currency_exchange
#: model:ir.model.fields,help:pos_nm_currency_exchange.field_pos_nm_exchange__value_in
msgid ""
"Value of the notes received at the cash rate of the point of sale (the rate "
"of Odoo with the cash rate margin, or the fixed rate)."
msgstr ""
"Valor de los billetes recibidos al tipo de caja del punto de venta (el tipo "
"de Odoo con el margen del tipo de caja, o el tipo fijo)."

#. module: pos_nm_currency_exchange
#: model:ir.model.fields,field_description:pos_nm_currency_exchange.field_pos_nm_exchange__linked_value
msgid "Value with Linked Operations"
msgstr "Valor con operaciones vinculadas"

#. module: pos_nm_currency_exchange
#: model:ir.model.fields,help:pos_nm_currency_exchange.field_pos_config__nm_exchange_origin_threshold
#: model:ir.model.fields,help:pos_nm_currency_exchange.field_res_config_settings__pos_nm_exchange_origin_threshold
msgid ""
"Value, in the currency of the point of sale, above which the customer "
"declares the origin of the funds (with the linked operations when a period "
"is set). 0: never required."
msgstr ""
"Valor, en la moneda del punto de venta, a partir del cual el cliente declara"
" el origen de los fondos (con las operaciones vinculadas cuando se define un"
" periodo). 0: nunca obligatorio."

#. module: pos_nm_currency_exchange
#: model:ir.model.fields,help:pos_nm_currency_exchange.field_pos_config__nm_exchange_document_threshold
#: model:ir.model.fields,help:pos_nm_currency_exchange.field_res_config_settings__pos_nm_exchange_document_threshold
msgid ""
"Value, in the currency of the point of sale, above which the identity "
"document of the customer is recorded on the operation (with the linked "
"operations when a period is set). 0: never required."
msgstr ""
"Valor, en la moneda del punto de venta, a partir del cual se registra el "
"documento de identidad del cliente en la operación (con las operaciones "
"vinculadas cuando se define un periodo). 0: nunca obligatorio."

#. module: pos_nm_currency_exchange
#: model:ir.model.fields,help:pos_nm_currency_exchange.field_pos_config__nm_exchange_review_threshold
#: model:ir.model.fields,help:pos_nm_currency_exchange.field_res_config_settings__pos_nm_exchange_review_threshold
msgid ""
"Value, in the currency of the point of sale, above which the operation is "
"flagged To Review for the compliance officer (with the linked operations "
"when a period is set). It is never refused at the counter. 0: never flagged."
msgstr ""
"Valor, en la moneda del punto de venta, a partir del cual la operación se "
"marca Por revisar para el responsable de cumplimiento (con las operaciones "
"vinculadas cuando se define un periodo). Nunca se rechaza en la ventanilla. "
"0: nunca marcada."

